      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "33e1c5ed479c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Are you planning to study in Canada? One of the most important steps in your journey is proving your English language proficiency. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "40a8f0718d45",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS (International English Language Testing System)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9daf3f674e64",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is widely accepted by Canadian universities, and understanding the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9fbd33ddd6ee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "minimum IELTS score requirements"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ba26dd3fd503",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is crucial for a smooth application process."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "49b2763963a5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "92581f925c3f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why IELTS Matters for Studying in Canada"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e276647d8507",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e799626a4f7a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Canada is home to some of the world’s top-ranked universities, offering globally recognized degrees. Since English is one of the official languages of Canada, universities require proof of English proficiency to ensure students can succeed academically."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ed746e5e330a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b05c487af85d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "64e1a112e77f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "d56bf86eaa40",
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS Academic test"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f040e5dec0e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "d56bf86eaa40"
          ],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "80fee2ed5772",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "is commonly used to assess your readiness. Both undergraduate and postgraduate programs set minimum band score requirements for admission."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "d56bf86eaa40",
          "_type": "link",
          "blank": false,
          "href": "https://admizzeducation.com/test-preparation/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "180e89285bfa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3e5ef96ffa13",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What is the Minimum IELTS Score Required?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "221acd0a7e38",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "546deba072ef",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most Canadian universities require:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9546966dca59",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a72e7e50b5fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Overall Band Score:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "10c801c9cac7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "803fae85a078",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "6.5"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "40ff6906a97d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6c56947576f1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Minimum Individual Band:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6e52938098dd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f191259ee526",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "6.0"
        },
        {
          "_key": "83e4dc541926",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in Listening, Reading, Writing, and Speaking"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "30363791d293",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "472d2e3244b3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "However, some institutions and programs may offer conditional admission to applicants who are still below the required score."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "42820a4505e4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "63a59441fc47",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "IELTS Score Requirements for Top Canadian Universities"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8bdc8a2bc07f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c91eaa74f5f6",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table class=\"responsive-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>University</th>\n        <th>Undergraduate</th>\n        <th>Postgraduate</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">University of Toronto</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">7.0 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">University of British Columbia</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">McGill University</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">University of Alberta</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">University of Waterloo</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">7.0 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">Simon Fraser University</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">6.5–7.0</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">York University</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">7.0–7.5</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">Concordia University</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">6.5–7.0</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td data-label=\"University\">Dalhousie University</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Undergraduate\">6.5 overall</td>\n        <td data-label=\"Postgraduate\">7.0 overall</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8b884cc73404",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a76f8f437709",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Note:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a1e9266b393f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Requirements may vary depending on the program. Engineering, law, and healthcare-related fields often have higher language score expectations."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6e6b8b6c73ce",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2bab6353e51f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What If You Don’t Meet the Minimum Score?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2f45569d1f5b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "78258322e2eb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don’t worry—there are several options:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a4bc44056379",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "68106a22c8d3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS Retake"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dfecaabe3970",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "98c3a96a0057",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You can retake the test and aim for a higher score, especially if you’re falling short in one or two bands."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "fb90524674fa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "269f887196eb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Conditional Admission"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5dc664f6252b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b8252073b665",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some universities allow conditional offers if you complete their English language programs before starting your main course."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4c2875633196",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "52e2ce35edd4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Check the current study permit rules: "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e1bace4239f7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Student Direct Stream (SDS) ended on November 8, 2024, so all applicants now apply through the regular study permit stream. Confirm the English score your university and IRCC require before you apply. See the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "56a02fd066fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "e19bf69abf21"
          ],
          "text": "IRCC notice on the end of the SDS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2a81d1c8aee8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "e19bf69abf21",
          "_type": "link",
          "blank": true,
          "href": "https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/notices/end-student-direct-stream-nigeria-student-express.html"
        }
